{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CubeScape</strong> is a first-person atmospheric experience set in a vanishing world of illusions, abstract geometry, and philosophical mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You enter a gallery called <i>Tesseract</i> \u2014 but the walls begin to dissolve, the exhibits fade, and you're left wandering impossible cubic spaces. There are no dialogues, no HUD, no tutorials. Only perception, interaction, and the quiet unraveling of what you thought was real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 This <strong>free demo</strong> includes one complete level that showcases the core mechanics of the full game \u2014 including illusions, puzzles, and object-based interaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c Explore surreal, dreamlike environments from a first-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Solve spatial puzzles and navigate optical illusions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f Interact with strange objects and activate mysterious mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive storytelling through environment and sound \u2014 no text, no UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda4 Inspired by Malevich, Escher, and <i>2001: A Space Odyssey</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 Themes of memory, perception, and self-reflection</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821480/a19d6aec77d95e019f7c065be9eeedd74d36780f.jpg"},{"name":"Blackhole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821480/a19d6aec77d95e019f7c065be9eeedd74d36780f.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821480?t=1752981068","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/